    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d710a-42">

                <pb facs="0344" n="164" sameAs="frus:frus1945Berlinv02/pg164"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">Truman Papers</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">United States Delegation Working Paper</hi><anchor
                        n="5" xml:id="d710a-42-f1"/></head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>Potsdam</placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1945-07-20T16:00:00+03:00">July 20, 1945, 4 p.m.</date>
                </dateline>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Agenda for Meeting of Heads of
                        Three Governments July</hi> 20, 1945 4:00 <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >p.m.</hi></p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Council of Ministers.<anchor n="6" xml:id="d710a-42-f2"/></item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>Italy in the United Nations, including reference to Spain.<anchor n="7"
                            xml:id="d710a-42-f3"/></item>
                    <label>3.</label>
                    <item>Vienna—Austria (paper to be presented by Mr. Churchill).<anchor n="8"
                            xml:id="d710a-42-f4"/></item>
                    <label>4.</label>
                    <item>Western frontiers of Poland (paper presented by U. S. S. R. this
                            morning).<anchor n="9" xml:id="d710a-42-f5"/></item>
                    <label>5.</label>
                    <item>Trusteeship (paper presented by U. S. S. R. this morning).<anchor n="9"
                            xml:id="d710a-42-f6"/></item>
                    <label>6.</label>
                    <item>Turkey (paper to be presented by Mr. Churchill).<anchor n="9"
                            xml:id="d710a-42-f7"/></item>
                </list>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d710a-42-f1" n="5" type="source" xml:id="d710a-42-f1-content">
                <p>This paper, presumably a United States Delegation working paper prepared for
                    Truman, was apparently before the President during the course of the meeting.
                    For the documents referred to, see the footnotes to the Thompson minutes, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">infra.</hi></p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d710a-42-f2" n="6" xml:id="d710a-42-f2-content">
                <p>At this point is the following manuscript notation by Truman: “disposed of”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d710a-42-f3" n="7" xml:id="d710a-42-f3-content">
                <p>At this point is the following manuscript notation by Truman: “Referred to
                    For[eign] Sec[retarie]s”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d710a-42-f4" n="8" xml:id="d710a-42-f4-content">
                <p>At this point is the following manuscript notation by Truman: “Settled”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d710a-42-f5" n="9" xml:id="d710a-42-f5-content">
                <p>At the end of this item is the following manuscript notation by Truman:
                    “Postponed”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d710a-42-f6" n="9" xml:id="d710a-42-f6-content">
                <p>At the end of this item is the following manuscript notation by Truman:
                    “Postponed”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d710a-42-f7" n="9" xml:id="d710a-42-f7-content">
                <p>At the end of this item is the following manuscript notation by Truman:
                    “Postponed”.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
